{"version":1,"content":"<p>蒙古國近日發生草原大火，自上周五（9日）至今不斷向中蒙邊境線蔓延，內蒙古2000多人正加緊堵截。</p><p>新華社報道，截至昨日（11日）晚上9時，堵截工作仍在繼續，大火暫未蔓延入境。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:02:53.076482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T06:57:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T15:37:43.041989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:40.035674+00:00","content_hash":"07ba8ce4635c441c025806fdc8d6c6557bb13d6ac3ad7af5333e217e11993dc4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}